TITLE 1D exchange transport problem
SOLUTION 0
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0 charge
SOLUTION 1-10
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0 charge
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X- 0.001
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -lengths 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -print_cells 1-10
    -print_frequency 1
PRINT
    -reset false
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selout.out
    -reset false
    -step true
    -molalities NaX
END